=== GENERAL ===
- main game running word (1x32 bit), this is the FIRST word processed
|---------------------------------------------------|
00 00 00 00   __ __ __ __   __ __ __ __   __ __ __ __
|---| |---|
PROTOCOL ID
- 0x0000 = general (you are here)
- 0x0001 = target 
- 0x0002 = lighting
- 0x0110 = return
      |---|
      MODE
      - 0x0000 = idle
      - 0x0001 = target reset (bring servos to 0°)
      - 0x0010 = run game
      - 0x0011 = run debug (optional target defined on [0x0101,0x1000])

__ __ __ __   00 00 00 00   __ __ __ __   __ __ __ __
              |---| |---|
              TARGET ID
              - 0-11 [0x0000, 0x1011] for each target (12)
              - 12 (0x1100) for all targets
              - 15 (0x1111) for controller itself
                    |---|
                    RESERVED

__ __ __ __   __ __ __ __   00 00 00 00   __ __ __ __
                            |---------|
                            GAME RUN TIME
                            - 10s increments (i.e. 0x00000001 = 1 x 10 = 10s, 0x00001111 = 15 x 10 = 150s or 2m30s)

__ __ __ __   __ __ __ __   __ __ __ __   00 00 00 00
                                          |---------|
                                          RESERVED